          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ali nokulipila wishi kwa mukashana amashekeli ya silifa amakumi yasano (50). Afwile ukuupa umukashana pantu namonaula pakusendama nankwe. Kabili umwaume tafwile ukumuleka mpaka imfwa.",
          "type": "text",
